- `src/synthlab/processes/doctor.py` validates new models and enforces positive bounds even when ParamSpec is used; lognormal `sigma_log` now must be > 0.
- `conf/wafer_particles/size_models/*.yaml` adds defaults; `tests/test_wafer_particles_size_models.py` extends registry and determinism coverage plus `type` alias.

