Using S20_HYDRA_CONFIG, S40_PROCESS_IMPLEMENTATION, S70_VISUALIZATION_DS, and S98_GOVERNANCE per task requirements (configs, plugin implementation, viz considerations, and test coverage).

Added Weibull/Pareto size model plugins, resolved `type` aliases to namespaced model keys so Hydra configs behave as intended, and tightened doctor validation for positive-only parameters with ParamSpec support; also added default YAML configs and tests for new models.

- `src/synthlab/domains/wafer_particles/generators/size_models/common.py` now resolves `type` to namespaced model names; mixture components normalize short names.
- `src/synthlab/domains/wafer_particles/generators/size_models/weibull.py` and `src/synthlab/domains/wafer_particles/generators/size_models/pareto.py` implement the new distributions with clamp handling.
- `src/synthlab/processes/doctor.py` validates new models and enforces positive bounds even when ParamSpec is used; lognormal `sigma_log` now must be > 0.
- `conf/wafer_particles/size_models/*.yaml` adds defaults; `tests/test_wafer_particles_size_models.py` extends registry and determinism coverage plus `type` alias.

